      "comment": [
        "A model the operator of a self-hosted install hosts, or any other server that speaks the",
        "OpenAI chat completions API. The address is an operator setting of the install: no",
        "workspace, chat or agent can name it. It is configured when the address is set; the key",
        "is optional, because a server on the operator's own machine usually needs none.",
        "Nothing is known about a model at such an address, so this proxy runs only the model",
        "names the operator wrote in its env settings: a request for any other name runs the",
        "operator's model for that use case. It takes any model name and so claims none, and it",
        "is served only where the self-host switch is true, so the hosted product never routes here."
      ],
